symbol index_files
lines 0 76
hash a50e75fa754557c6
note Three stages against a server (anything IndexQueries answers: an LspSession, or a test's stand-in), each sent whole through request_all: the batch's document symbols, a call-hierarchy item for every symbol, the outgoing calls of every item. The answers come back in the order asked and are matched to their file and symbol by position; each symbol's targets are sorted and deduplicated. One ServerFile per file whose every request was answered, in order. A file with any request refused or lost (rust-analyzer refuses with 'content modified' while files change under it) is left out rather than returned with the symbols or calls it is missing: returned, it would be cached as a server answer and never asked again, which left whole files with no callees.

